    "title": "Boundary Traversal of a Binary Tree",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a binary tree, print the boundary traversal consisting of the root, left boundary, all leaf nodes from left to right, and the right boundary in reverse order without duplicates.",
